{"seq":3,"slug":"animation-range","title":"animation-range 区间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-scroll-driven-animations/css-api/animation-range","wordCount":1248,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"animation-range-区间\">animation-range 区间</h1><p>时间线给出一条从 0% 到 100% 的完整进度，但你很少想用满整条。揭示动画希望「元素进入视口的前 30% 行程内」就淡入完成；视差希望背景在「元素覆盖视口的整个过程」里匀速位移。<code>animation-range</code> 就是那把裁剪刀——它在时间线上划出一个子区间，告诉动画「只在这一段里播放」。被 2026 年的文章称为「现代 CSS 最重要的升级之一」的，正是它配合 <code>entry</code>/<code>exit</code>/<code>cover</code>/<code>contain</code> 关键字带来的电影级精确控制。时间线本身从哪来是 <a href=\"scroll-timeline\">scroll-timeline</a> 与 <a href=\"view-timeline\">view-timeline</a> 的事，本篇只管「在时间线上取哪一段」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>animation-range</code> 在时间线的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 上裁出一个子区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a,b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，并把动画自己的 0%–100% 线性拉伸映射到这段上——它改变的是「映射关系」，不是「播放时刻」。起止两端各写「关键字 + 可选百分比偏移」。关键字是 <code>view-timeline</code> 的语义锚点，把元素穿越视口的过程切成阶段：<code>cover</code>（与视口有任意重叠的全程）、<code>entry</code>（开始进入到完全进入）、<code>exit</code>（开始离开到完全离开）、<code>contain</code>（完全容纳或完全覆盖阶段）。区间外靠 <code>fill: both</code> 维持端点状态。一个元素挂多条动画、各占不同 <code>animation-range</code>，就能拼出分段叙事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"起点与终点\">起点与终点</h2><p><code>animation-range</code> 设两个值：起点和终点，各自是「关键字 + 可选百分比偏移」。最简单的形式直接用百分比：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".card {&#10;  animation: reveal auto linear both;&#10;  animation-timeline: view();&#10;  animation-range: 0% 50%;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: reveal </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> linear</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: view();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这表示动画在可见性进度的 0% 到 50% 之间播放完毕，后半段元素一直保持终态。也可拆成 <code>animation-range-start: 0%</code> 与 <code>animation-range-end: 50%</code> 两个长属性。百分比直接好懂，但它对应的是「整条时间线」的百分比，在 view-timeline 下不够语义化——你更想表达「在元素进入阶段」而非「在某个抽象百分比」。这正是关键字存在的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四个区间关键字\">四个区间关键字</h2><p><code>entry</code>、<code>exit</code>、<code>cover</code>、<code>contain</code> 是 view-timeline 的命名锚点，把「元素穿过视口」这个过程切成有语义的阶段。理解它们要盯住两个边缘：元素自己的边缘和视口的边缘。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;元素从底部冒头&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;cover 0% / entry 0%&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;元素完全进入 entry 100%&lt;br/&gt;= contain 0%(若元素比视口矮)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;元素完全离开前 contain 100%&lt;br/&gt;= exit 0%&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;元素从顶部消失&lt;br/&gt;exit 100% / cover 100%&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"元素从底部冒头\"] --&gt; B[\"cover 0% / entry 0%\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"元素完全进入 entry 100%&lt;br/&gt;= contain 0%(若元素比视口矮)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"元素完全离开前 contain 100%&lt;br/&gt;= exit 0%\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"元素从顶部消失&lt;br/&gt;exit 100% / cover 100%\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关键字</th>\n<th>区间含义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>cover</code></td>\n<td>元素与视口有任何重叠的整个过程</td>\n<td>视差,要全程位移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>entry</code></td>\n<td>从开始进入到完全进入</td>\n<td>揭示动画的「淡入」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exit</code></td>\n<td>从开始离开到完全离开</td>\n<td>离场动画的「淡出」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>contain</code></td>\n<td>元素完全在视口内(或视口完全被元素覆盖)的阶段</td>\n<td>钉住期间的内部动画</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最常用的揭示写法是 <code>animation-range: entry 0% entry 100%</code>——动画恰好在元素「进入视口」这一阶段内播完，等元素完全进来时刚好显示到位，自然又克制。想要进入更晚开始、更早结束，就加偏移：<code>entry 25% entry 75%</code>。<code>cover</code> 适合视差，因为视差要在元素可见的全程持续位移。<code>contain</code> 配合钉住效果，是 <a href=\"../patterns/parallax-pinning\">视差与钉住</a> 和 <a href=\"../patterns/sticky-scroll-effects\">粘性滚动叙事</a> 的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区间如何重映射进度\">区间如何重映射进度</h2><p>关键的心智模型：<code>animation-range</code> 不是「在某段时间外不播放」，而是「把动画的 0%-100% 重新映射到时间线的这个子区间上」。设你写了 <code>animation-range: entry 0% entry 100%</code>，而 <code>entry</code> 阶段对应整条 view 时间线的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a, b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，那么动画进度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 与时间线进度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系是一次线性拉伸：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = \\frac{p - a}{b - a}, \\quad p \\in [a, b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，时间线进度走到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 时动画才从 0% 起步，走到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 时动画到 100%，区间外靠 <code>fill: both</code> 保持端点。这解释了一个常见疑惑：缩短区间会让动画「显得更快」——同样的滚动行程被压进更短的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a,b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，单位滚动对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 增量变大。这个拉伸模型和 <a href=\"../foundations/timeline-model\">时间线模型</a> 里的归一化是同一套数学的二次应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多动画分段编排\">多动画分段编排</h2><p>一个元素可以挂多条动画，各自用不同的 <code>animation-range</code> 占据时间线的不同段，拼出「进入时淡入、停留时变色、离开时淡出」的连续叙事：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".hero {&#10;  animation:&#10;    fade-in auto linear both,&#10;    recolor auto linear both,&#10;    fade-out auto linear both;&#10;  animation-timeline: view(), view(), view();&#10;  animation-range:&#10;    entry 0% entry 100%,&#10;    contain 0% contain 100%,&#10;    exit 0% exit 100%;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.hero</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fade-in </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> linear</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    recolor </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> linear</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fade-out </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> linear</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: view(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">view</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">view</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entry </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    contain</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> contain</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exit </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exit </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条动画分别铺在 <code>entry</code>、<code>contain</code>、<code>exit</code> 三个相邻阶段，浏览器自动衔接，全程在合成线程完成。这种「用 range 切片再拼接」的手法，是把单调的全程映射升级成电影分镜的关键，也是模式章里复杂效果的底层套路。需要留意的是阶段之间别留缝或重叠过头，否则会有视觉跳变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>animation-range</code> 在时间线上裁子区间,起止各为「关键字+偏移」,动画只在此区间播放、区间外靠 <code>both</code> 保持。</li>\n<li>四关键字按「元素穿越视口」分阶段：<code>cover</code>(全程重叠)、<code>entry</code>(进入)、<code>exit</code>(离开)、<code>contain</code>(完全容纳)。</li>\n<li>区间是把动画 0%-100% 线性拉伸映射到子区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q=(p-a)/(b-a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>,缩短区间让动画显得更快。</li>\n<li>一元素多动画各占不同 range,可拼出「进入淡入→停留变色→离开淡出」的电影级分镜。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：时间线来源见 <a href=\"scroll-timeline\">scroll-timeline</a> 与 <a href=\"view-timeline\">view-timeline</a>；区间映射的数学根在 <a href=\"../foundations/timeline-model\">时间线模型</a>；<code>contain</code>/<code>cover</code> 的实战用法见 <a href=\"../patterns/parallax-pinning\">视差与钉住</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库链接：分段编排与时序的通用设计见 <a href=\"../../frontend-microinteractions/motion/orchestration-sequencing\">microinteractions 的编排与时序</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://dev.to/nickbenksim/creating-complex-scroll-driven-animations-with-pure-css-in-2026-17l\">Creating Complex Scroll-driven Animations with Pure CSS in 2026 · DEV</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Scroll-driven_animations/Timelines\">Scroll-driven animation timelines · MDN</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"animation-range 区间","id":"animation-range-区间"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"起点与终点","id":"起点与终点"},{"level":2,"text":"四个区间关键字","id":"四个区间关键字"},{"level":2,"text":"区间如何重映射进度","id":"区间如何重映射进度"},{"level":2,"text":"多动画分段编排","id":"多动画分段编排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"view-timeline 可见性进度时间线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-scroll-driven-animations/css-api/view-timeline"},"next":{"title":"进度与揭示效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-scroll-driven-animations/patterns/progress-reveal"}}